      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Jinx receives massively increased Move Speed and Attack Speed whenever she helps kill or destroy an enemy champions epic jungle monster, or structure.",
      "summary_zh": "金克丝每当参与击杀或摧毁一名英雄、一个史诗级野怪或一座建筑物后，她的移动速度和攻击速度就会得到显著提升。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1307591:3973632"
      ]
