      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Jinx modifies her basic attacks by swapping between Pow-Pow, her minigun and Fishbones, her rocket launcher. Attacks with Pow-Pow grant Attack Speed, while attacks with Fishbones deal area of effect damage, gain increased range, but drain Mana and attack slower.",
      "summary_zh": "金克丝可以通过切换武器来改变普通攻击的方式。在用她的轻机枪“砰砰”攻击时，她的攻击速度会提升。在用她的火箭发射器“鱼骨头”攻击时，她的普通攻击会造成范围伤害，攻击距离提升，但会消耗法力值并且攻击得更慢。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1307593:4052475"
      ]
    },
